'''Bats''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2016 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is blue, which fades into a black with a swarm of bats imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event [[Boxes|box]] ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].

